{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261127/photo/bkn-20261127213043423-1127_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261127215620\"/><p>涉事骸骨在大網仔路與鳳秀路交界附近被發現。</p><p>今午(27日)1時39分，執法部門接獲報案，指在西貢大網仔路與鳳秀路交界對開岩石岸的石間，發現疑似人類頭骨。警員其後到場，將相關懷疑骸骨檢走作進一步化驗。案件暫列「發現人類骸骨」跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:34:51.127174+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T13:30:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T14:57:21.502427+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T14:28:12.222995+00:00","content_hash":"82b3fdd61dea3ad6d4cb3015609d360438df54387ca431f14088d61d07f9fe5f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}